Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 11:36:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(net)!: migrate extend, favorite and friend packets

Adapt five user packets to immutable typed VOs and enum-based favorite
item kinds. Extract friend bonus mapping and update download call sites.
Remove obsolete network helpers and extend packet integration coverage.

Validation: 113 tests pass; two regression cases still expose the existing
favorite-item pagination defect, which remains unchanged.

BREAKING CHANGE: The five packet classes are now internal, and favorite
item queries require FavoriteItemKind. NetPacketUtil.GetUserAgent and
NetPacketUtil.CopyMember are removed.

